---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Instructions | I ching';
const description = 'Instructions on how to use the I ching consulting tool';
---

<Layout {title} {description}>
  <div>
    <h1 class="title">Instructions</h1>

    <h2 class="subtitle">Prepare your question</h2>
    <p>
      You can ask what ever you want to the <i>I ching</i> but you must know that it is convenient to think
      a real question. You may have to take a time to think what is that you really want to know abot your
      present situation or your future scenaries.
    </p>
    <br />
    <h2 class="subtitle">Throw coins</h2>
    <p>
      Once you have your question ready, you have to throw 6 rounds of three coins. This app, will help you
      to make it virtually.
    </p>
    <a href="/consult">
      <button class="bg-button-bg text-button-text hover:bg-button-hover active:shadow-sm shadow-md transition-all rounded-md m-3 px-2 py-2">
        Toss coins
      </button>
    </a>
  </div>
</Layout>
